        <li><a href="https://www.bis.org/cpmi/publ/d230.htm" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Harmonised ISO 20022 data requirements for enhancing cross-border payments — technical annex</a> &mdash; BIS Committee on Payments and Market Infrastructures (CPMI), 26 February 2026.</li>
        <li><a href="https://www.swift.com/standards/iso-20022/removal-unstructured-address" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">ISO 20022 — Removal of unstructured address</a> &mdash; Swift, 2026.</li>
      </ul>
