      </ul> </div> <!-- SINGLE CTA --> <div class="cta-section"> <h3>See ioNova ARS in action</h3> <p>The complete ISO 20022 Postal Address &mdash; Requirements and Specifications Update 2026 consolidates the CPMI harmonisation requirements, the BIS PIE taskforce report, the PMPG Hybrid Postal Address whitepaper and the EPC address guidance into a single reference.</p> <a class="btn btn-accent" href="https://ionova.ai/demo">Book a demo <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg></a> </div> </section> <section class="section"> <div class="section-label">Related Terms</div> <h2 class="section-title">See also</h2> <div class="related-grid"> <a class="related-card" href="/glossary/pacs-008"><h4>pacs.008</h4><p>pacs.008 (FIToFICustomerCreditTransfer) carries customer credit transfers between FIs — the MX successor to MT…</p></a> <a class="related-card" href="/glossary/iso-20022"><h4>ISO 20022</h4><p>ISO 20022 is the open standard for financial messaging — pacs, pain, camt XML. From 15 November 2026 payment a…</p></a> <a class="related-card" href="/glossary/adrline"><h4>AdrLine</h4><p>AdrLine is the free-format element of the ISO 20022 PstlAdr block: 70 characters per line, up to 7 in unstruct…</p></a> <a class="related-card" href="/glossary/straight-through-processing"><h4>Straight-through processing (STP)</h4><p>STP is automated payment processing without manual intervention. Cross-border baselines sit near 40%; ioNova A…</p></a> <a class="related-card" href="/glossary/mt103-mx-mapping"><h4>MT 103 to MX address mapping</h4><p>Converting party addresses between SWIFT MT and ISO 20022: end parties map via Option F, agents via Option D; …</p></a> </div> </section> </article>
